    {
      "id": "conditional_process_execution_with_metadata_parsing",
      "title": "Conditional Process Execution with Metadata Parsing",
      "description": "This pattern demonstrates how to conditionally execute a process based on input metadata and parse metadata from filenames within the process script. It is useful for workflows where certain processes should only run for specific types of input data, and where metadata needs to be extracted dynamically from input filenames.",
      "use_cases": [
        "When you need to run a process only for specific sequencing technologies (e.g., nanopore).",
        "When metadata embedded in filenames needs to be parsed and used for output naming and organization.",
        "When different processes in a workflow need to share and use parsed metadata."
      ],
      "groovy_code": "process centrifuge {\n    when:\n      isCompatibleWithSeqType(reads, ['nanopore'], task.process)\n    input:\n      tuple val(riscd_input), path(reads)\n    output:\n      path '*'\n      tuple path(\"${base}_genus.report\"), path(\"${base}_species.report\"), path(\"${base}_KrakenLike.report\"), emit: reports\n    script:\n      md = parseMetadataFromFileName(reads.getName())\n      base = \"${md.ds}-${ex.dt}_${md.cmp}_${METHOD}\"\n      \"\"\"\n        centrifuge -p ${task.cpus} -x ${DB_PATH}/${DB_NAME} -U ${reads} -S ${base}.output --report-file ${base}.report\n        head -n 1 ${base}.report > ${base}_genus.report; grep -w \"genus\" ${base}.report | sort -t \"\\t\" -nr -k5 >> ${base}_genus.report\n        head -n 1 ${base}.report > ${base}_species.report; grep -w \"species\" ${base}.report | sort -t \"\\t\" -nr -k5 >> ${base}_species.report\n        centrifuge-kreport -X ${DB_PATH}/${DB_NAME} ${base}.report > ${base}_KrakenLike.report\n      \"\"\"\n}",
      "caveats": [
        "The `when` clause must return a boolean value; otherwise, the process will not execute.",
        "The `parseMetadataFromFileName` function must be defined and correctly parse the expected metadata from the filename.",
        "The metadata parsed from the filename must include all required fields (e.g., `ds`, `cmp`) to avoid null pointer exceptions.",
        "The `isCompatibleWithSeqType` function must be defined and correctly identify the sequencing technology."
      ]
    },
    {
