      "id": "metadata_driven_publish_patterns",
      "title": "Metadata-Driven Dynamic Publishing with Pattern Matching",
      "description": "This pattern shows how to dynamically publish files to different directories based on metadata values, using pattern matching and saveAs transformations. It demonstrates complex output organization that maintains traceability through metadata.",
