      "id": "conditional_branching_with_regex_patterns",
      "title": "Conditional Branching with Regex Patterns",
      "description": "This pattern demonstrates how to use the `.branch` operator to route input data into multiple channels based on regex matching. It is particularly useful for categorizing input data into distinct processing paths without manual filtering.",
      "use_cases": [
