      "groovy_code": "getNCBICodes().branch {\n    gcf: it ==~ /(?i)^GCF.+/\n    gca: it ==~ /(?i)^GCA.+/\n    sra: it ==~ /(?i)^SRR.+|(?i)^ERR.+|(?i)^DRR.+/\n    nuccore: true\n}.set { branched }",
      "caveats": [
        "The regex patterns must be mutually exclusive to avoid data being routed to multiple branches.",
        "The `true` condition in the `nuccore` branch acts as a catch-all, which may lead to unintended data routing if not carefully managed.",
